{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36285","headline":"赠上虞胡少府百篇 · 方干","name":"赠上虞胡少府百篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"求仙不在链金丹，轻举由来别有门。\n日晷未移三十刻，风骚已及四千言。\n宏才尚遣居卑位，公道何曾雪至冤。\n歛板尘中无恨色，应缘利禄副晨昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}